WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
fentanyl and other drugs.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.160
Each boat that we sink carries drugs

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.480
that would kill more than 25,000 Americans.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.240
We will not let that happen.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.540
Energy is another area where the United States

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.120
is now thriving like never before.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.719
We're getting rid of the falsely named renewables.

